### shiroikuma-termux-gui fork ###
# Release signing: the credentials and the key itself never enter git. (Upstream's tracked
# app/dev_keystore.jks is its DEBUG key and stays tracked — a pattern does not untrack it.)
/keystore.properties
*.jks
# Agent config is committed (CLAUDE.md, .claude/skills/); only the machine-local settings are not.
/.claude/settings.local.json
# Agent working files: generator scripts, intermediate data, throwaway exports.
/.scratch/
# `local.properties` (sdk.dir) is already covered by upstream's rules above.
